// Remote Code Execution via WinRM and PowerShell Remoting
// Detects child processes of the WinRM host, which is how Enter-PSSession and Invoke-Command land code on a remote machine. Expect noise wherever fleets are managed with PSRemoting; pair this with an allowlist of admin source hosts.
// techniques: T1021.006   severity: medium   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1021.006
//   Invoke-Command -ComputerName <host> -ScriptBlock { whoami }
// source: rules/lateral-movement/winrm-remoting-child-process.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((ParentProcessName endswith "\\wsmprovhost.exe"))
